---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
const updated = 'September 14, 2026';
---

<Base title={`Terms of Use | ${SITE.name}`} description={`Terms of use for ${SITE.name}: free tools provided as-is, with no warranty.`} path="/terms/">
  <article class="prose-tool mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="muted text-sm">Last updated: {updated}</p>

    <h2>Use of the tools</h2>
    <p>{SITE.name} provides free online utilities for personal and commercial use. You may use them as often as you like, provided you do not attempt to disrupt the service, scrape it at abusive rates, or reproduce the site in whole.</p>

    <h2>No warranty</h2>
    <p>The tools are provided &quot;as is&quot; without warranty of any kind. While we test them carefully, we do not guarantee that results are correct, complete or suitable for any particular purpose. Always verify output before relying on it in production systems.</p>

    <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, {SITE.name} and its operator shall not be liable for any loss or damage arising from the use of, or inability to use, this website or its tools.</p>

    <h2>Security tools</h2>
    <p>Tools such as the password generator and hash generator are provided for legitimate development and security purposes. You are responsible for how you use their output.</p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update these terms at any time. Continued use of the site after changes are posted constitutes acceptance.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p><a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`} class="text-brand-600 underline">{SITE.contactEmail}</a></p>
  </article>
</Base>
